  "finding": "On A, uniform DQN led at the 0.15 score. Both DQN guides reduced waiting and served fewer visits. Short-wait PPO led the learned A arms under the original 0.05 score. On B and C, short-wait DQN was the strongest learned arm on both scales. On D, short-wait PPO was the strongest learned arm, beating Random across all three training seeds. Standalone ACO led on every layout.",
